==Battleground==
*2 [[SV-001 (Enemy)|SV-001s]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[SV-001 (Enemy)|SV-001]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[SV-001 (Enemy)|SV-001]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.
*1 [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCO]] spawns after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>.
*1 [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCO]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCOs]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[HUGE HERMIT (Enemy)|HUGE HERMIT]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[SV-001 (Enemy)|SV-001s]] spawn, delay 44~66 seconds<sup>1,320f~1,980f</sup>.

==Strategy==
On lower ♛ difficulties this is an easy stage that pretty much any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. However, HUGE HERMIT can become a moderate threat at 3 and especially 4♛ difficulty. This being said, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can obliterate HUGE HERMIT extremely fast if you have them and is usable on all ♛ difficulties, so possessing them turns the stage into a joke once more.

